      "category": "Text",
      "text": "TRANSFER OF FUNCTIONS, POWERS AND DUTIES OF THE COUNCIL\nAGAINST POVERTY OF THE CITY OF NEW YORK TO THE ADMINISTRATOR\nOF THE HUMAN RESOURCES ADMINISTRATION",
